        "Apa cerita, Lisa? Jom minum kopi?"
      ]
    },
    "tech": {
      "scenario": "Your internet is down. You call your friend for advice and agree to try a solution he suggests.",
      "key_phrases": [
        "Camne ni? Internet saya tak berfungsi.",
